  zero risk of FIXED→OPEN flips since default Zenjxl bytes are
  byte-identical to pre-Phase-2)
- (d) `cargo test --lib` PASS: 1444/1444
- (e) Hash-locks 36/36 BYTE-IDENTICAL: ✓ (without regen — confirms
